<title>UK: London offshore tea auction offerings.</title>
<headline>London offshore tea auction offerings.</headline>
<text>
<p>Offshore offering for the Jul 28 London Tea Auction Totalled 1,600 packages of 53.50 kgs against   400 pkgs on Jul 21.</p>
<p>							   Last	  Prev</p>
<p>Kenya O/Sh Pkgs	    CIF   Offshore	 200	   200</p>
<p>Zimba. O/Sh Pkgs	   CIF   Offshore     1,400	   200</p>
<p>Jul 28 landed packages already listed totalled  4,018.</p>
</text>
